Bind Npc 24407 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14407 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 804 "[Crack of All Means] Yielding an outcome"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Advisor] Herga."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Advisor] Nez."

Requires player level >= 59 and quest 803 is completed

Rewards
    Give 1 of 900334000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Something seems very serious. Should we go talk to Herga?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Something must be serious. Talk to Nez."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "well..  I see..  It was you.."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "This isn't normal..  It's very serious.\n\nSomething was leaking and was contaminating..\n\nFor now, bring this [Cracking Report] to [Associate of Magic Advisor] Harrigon. And following his order, you'll need to take care of something. Hurry!\n\nTalk to Herga about the result of the study."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Oh no...  Ah you are back."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "This isn't normal..  It's very serious.\n\nSomething was leaking and was contaminating..\n\nFor now, bring this [Cracking Experiement Report] to [Associate of Magic Advisor] Marcus. And following his order, you'll need to take care of something. Hurry!\n\nTalk to Nez about the result of the study."

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "For now, bring this [Cracking Report] to [Associate of Magic Advisor] Harrigon. And following his order, you'll need to take care of something. Hurry!"
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "For now, bring this [Cracking Experiement Report] to [Associate of Magic Advisor] Marcus. And following his order, you'll need to take care of something. Hurry!"
